      <h1>Moving to Walton-on-Thames, Hersham or Whiteley Village? Your guide to living here</h1>
      <p class="hero-standfirst">Considering a move, recently arrived, or already living here? This independent guide covers the practical questions: which of the three communities fits, what housing and daily life cost, how commuting, schools and childcare work, and where to meet people. Whiteley Village is a charitable retirement village with eligibility rules, so it is treated separately rather than as ordinary housing.</p>
