        <p class="guide-intro">Time-sensitive information here, including house prices, rents, Council Tax, transport, schools and childcare, is dated and linked to the source it came from, so you can see how current it is and check it yourself.</p>

        <h2 id="at-a-glance">Walton-on-Thames at a glance</h2>
        <div class="table-wrap">
