        <h2 id="areas">Explore the areas</h2>
        <p>This guide covers three communities that share a postal address and very little else: a Thames-side town, a village with its own centre and station, and a charitable retirement village with its own rules about who can live there.</p>

        <h3 id="walton">Walton-on-Thames</h3>
        <p>There is no single official set of neighbourhood boundaries for the town. These six are <strong>practical local descriptions, not formal administrative divisions</strong>. Each is covered in full, with its streets drawn on a map, in our <a href="/living/areas/">guide to the areas of Walton-on-Thames</a>.</p>

